    "text": "At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>, a solution containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of solute in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math> of solution exerts an osmotic pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pa</mi></math>. The molar mass of the solute is g <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> (Nearest integer)<br />(Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>083</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> bar <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mo>&#160;</mo><mprescripts/><none/><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> )",
